  "description": "Dong-Hui, a part-timer struggling to make ends meet. She’d just fallen asleep after working her butt off at her part-time job late into the night, but when she opened her eyes, she found herself the owner of Grace Manor? \n\n\\[Bingo! Go ahead and take a look around this desperately poor manor! Hahaha\\]\n\n *“Hahaha… what’s that supposed to mean?”*\n\nAs if everything else wasn’t enough, now I’m supposed to revive this desperately poor estate too... Is this really not a dream? Why are you doing this to me!?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
